l overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-[100%] animate-[spin_3s_linear_infinite] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0 300deg, #4f46e5 360deg)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] rounded-[11px] z-0 block bg-white\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start h-full flex-1\"><div class=\"text-[#4f46e5] mb-4 bg-indigo-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Estruturação &amp; Sincronização de Dados</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-pretty flex-1 text-sm font-medium\">Coleta, tratamento e sincronização de dados entre planilhas, bancos e sistemas para manter tudo consistente em tempo real.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"w-full h-full group\"><div class=\"relative flex h-full flex-col p-6 rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 shadow-sm transition-colors\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-[100%] animate-[spin_3s_linear_infinite] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 pointer-events-none transition-opacity duration-500\" style=\"background:conic-gradient(from 0deg, transparent 0 300deg, #4f46e5 360deg)\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-[1px] rounded-[11px] z-0 block bg-white\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-start h-full flex-1\"><div class=\"text-[#4f46e5] mb-4 bg-indigo-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-indigo-100\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-line\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mb-2 text-slate-900 tracking-tight\">Dashboards &amp; Relatórios Automáticos</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-pretty flex-1 text-sm font-medium\">Painéis e relatórios que se atualizam sozinhos, transformando dados dispersos em indicadores claros para decisão.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24\" id=\"works\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Projetos em Destaque</h2><p class=\"text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-pretty text-lg\">Alguns dos fluxos e automações que desenvolvi em produção com n8n. Cada projeto demonstra integrações reais entre CRMs, plataformas de venda, IA e WhatsApp API.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-primary/20 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-[#4f46e5]/40 transition-colors bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-0 rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video mb-4 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Workflow n8n: Datar Etapas do Lead na Kommo\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/workflows/image1.png\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-2 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold group-hover:text-[#4f46e5] transition-colors mb-2 text-balance text-slate-900\">Datar Etapas do Lead na Kommo</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-1 text-pretty font-medium\">Recebe um webhook quando a etapa de um lead é alterada no Kommo CRM, calcula datas e prazos de forma automática e atualiza as informações do lead no sistema.</p><div class=\"mt-auto\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Tecnologias utilizadas:</h4><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">n8n</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">Webhooks</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">JavaScript</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">Kommo CRM</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">HTTP Requests</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-primary/20 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-[#4f46e5]/40 transition-colors bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-0 rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video mb-4 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Workflow n8n: LinkedIn Post Automático\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/workflows/image2.png\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-2 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold group-hover:text-[#4f46e5] transition-colors mb-2 text-balance text-slate-900\">LinkedIn Post Automático</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-1 text-pretty font-medium\">Acionado diariamente para ler um feed RSS de notícias. Usa a IA do Google Gemini para gerar um post atrativo e publica sozinho no LinkedIn.</p><div class=\"mt-auto\"><h4 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2\">Tecnologias utilizadas:</h4><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">n8n</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">Schedule</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">RSS Feed</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">LangChain</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">Google Gemini</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 text-[#4f46e5] border border-indigo-100\">API LinkedIn</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-primary/20 overflow-hidden group flex flex-col hover:border-[#4f46e5]/40 transition-colors bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm p-0 rounded-2xl\"><div class=\"relative aspect-video mb-4 rounded-t-2xl overflow-hidden bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200\"><img alt=\"Workflow n8n: Integração Hotmart (Eventos)\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-contain transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/workflows/image3.png\"/></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-2 flex-1 flex flex-col\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold group-hover:text-[#4f46e5] transition-colors mb-2 text-balance text-slate-900\">Integração Hotmart (Eventos)</h3><p class=\"text-slate-600 text-sm mb-4 flex-1 text-pretty font-medium\">Captura eventos em tempo real da Hotmart de